{"articleNo":"696","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=696&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▦2009-1 대학원 학위논문연구계획서 제출 안내▦","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.03.11","hit":"14314","attachments":[{"name":"대학원석박사학위논문연구계획서양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=696&attachNo=69413"},{"name":"산업대학원학위논문연구계획서양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=696&attachNo=69414"},{"name":"교육대학원학위논문연구계획서양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=696&attachNo=69415"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 427px; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 42px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"443\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"33\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><font size=\"3\">2009-1 대학원 학위논문연구계획서 제출 안내</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009학년도 1학기 대학원(산업,교육 포함) 학위논문연구계획서 제출대상자는 아래와 같이 소정의 기간내에 관련서류를 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 제출대상\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">대학원 석․박사과정 2학기차 재학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">산업 및 교육대학원 4학기차 재학생<font color=\"#ff1493\">(무논문과정신청자는 제외)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 제출기간 : <font color=\"#1e90ff\">2009. 3. 23(월) ~ 3. 27(금)[5일간]</font></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">3. 제출장소 : 대학원 각 학과(전공) 종합학사행정사무실&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">4. 제출양식 : 각 대학원별 학위논문연구계획서(다운로드)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">5. 유의사항 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong>학위논문연구계획서는 학위수여규정 상 반드시 </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 지정된 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong>학기에 </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong>제출해야함</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">6. 문의사항 : 각 학과(전공)사무실 및 대학원지원팀(478-7015)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">[첨부파일다운로드]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 대학원 석․박사 학위논문연구계획서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 산업대학원 학위논문연구계획서</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">3. 교육대학원 학위논문연구계획서</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">금오공과대학교 대학(산업,교육)원장<br><br><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
